+        - Inside the selection (grown by ``base_grow``): the result as it is.
+        - The new object: pixels that changed in a way a shadow cannot explain (other colour or
+          brighter), connected to the selection, within ``obj_grow``.
+        - Everywhere else in reach (``obj_grow`` and the shadow room): only shadow, as the cleaned
+          picture darkened by the result's own brightness ratio, same colour. Nothing else the model
